markdown\",\"title\":\"studysmarter.co.uk\",\"data\":\"Much of what is known about his life comes from the accounts of later historians, as few details of his personal life were recorded.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGvlL-q6_eurNTSpUh5qJQMRrHrCiu_-XPof3O2h1CNL5O--Wurch-7_LuIsiJVWWAnZcWGr3xwGhQVGJdcdF53VBLQGtAenSAHmdBr9Wr1hhqh6eV30cG7m8w4B8kg9XPh7tMBO2j6l9xastb8-K9ywJLh7c6Qj6VfN18LTdNZ98sfiiizMfhrQ4n6Ysw-uR5y\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":7,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"Archimedes became a renowned figure for his role in the defense of Syracuse against the Romans during the Punic Wars, where his formidable war machines held the invaders at bay.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEzmnHAg-PuDtAxx88NlWf33ipKlZ1PMqDc-dHecvJDz2NTy__ofnXQG0qpBgpjHGwyNrCDcAdZxdj0zlgw-ELoOAjxd-TQeyCFAtuY-0dbwpH2jhaTWAgE1h8GEeeSzu-MCY1ap5IX7YRiyUR90oSnLypwgq5yTQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":8,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"study.com\",\"data\":\"He was ultimately killed during the siege of Syracuse by a Roman soldier, despite orders that he should not be harmed\\u2014a death the Roman general Marcus Claudius Marcellus reportedly regretted.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGqVYNLy8QHv9PsZ_r57TozjVUurCKqkGGs-jq-4F1FRcI6XAckbkwp-ZDZq67RAXnjIIxiOcan1pm8A614PwwUsyKzURP62EsFqU0kGXP2JVgOkNJ1RrIfT9Xo23herT2N5aYLyUnAgPP0_iknGK5Hnqj2b5V7pj1jtar33pLHEFtF_xFVKseSk4q2srEZY36J4KdwR3hl9jzY\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":9,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"A sphere and a cylinder, representing one of his most cherished mathematical discoveries, were said to have been engraved on his tomb at his request.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfZa1LohQOtO3pE6Q3q9569dhQ-fd6cjFc0lqDn_qdTw7J98v9JKZCvTzNqKVMP28CJQ--d2Jc7--u6M5zs1XnjoGDCiPHzsI6EjEoMngtOfDNvgAytpCj75Ow1QwYYVbS9Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":10,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"sema.ce.gov.br\",\"data\":\"Archimedes's contributions to mathematics were revolutionary, combining rigorous geometric proofs with inventive problem-solving techniques.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwIBnC37tZUpDYxwPDzq224hgYASDNEAR5Zog3xfRlE9sJBbTOq8oC0bv-5JL5lOkPf9Lo4Cf01TTPnqC3xbyLBRiA8fdliTW1C1iMDcnFsLdX3sEotoHKiFewKaI8JxOD510gWSMjuY26jt0SA5FitLUhfehCmSE8CtKmFqw32o2bdsoS5iNlLuphPr4ky-c4vsRuuzHPZJevXRE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":11,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"sema.ce.gov.br\",\"data\":\"*   **Pioneering Calculus:** He developed the \\\"method of exhaustion,\\\" a precursor to integral calculus, to determine the areas of irregular shapes.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwIBnC37tZUpDYxwPDzq224hgYASDNEAR5Zog3xfRlE9sJBbTOq8oC0bv-5JL5lOkPf9Lo4Cf01TTPnqC3xbyLBRiA8fdliTW1C1iMDcnFsLdX3sEotoHKiFewKaI8JxOD510gWSMjuY26jt0SA5FitLUhfehCmSE8CtKmFqw32o2bdsoS5iNlLuphPr4ky-c4vsRuuzHPZJevXRE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":12,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"studysmarter.co.uk\",\"data\":\"This method allowed him to calculate the area under a parabola and the volumes of spheres and cylinders.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGvlL-q6_eurNTSpUh5qJQMRrHrCiu_-XPof3O2h1CNL5O--Wurch-7_LuIsiJVWWAnZcWGr3xwGhQVGJdcdF53VBLQGtAenSAHmdBr9Wr1hhqh6eV30cG7m8w4B8kg9XPh7tMBO2j6l9xastb8-K9ywJLh7c6Qj6VfN18LTdNZ98sfiiizMfhrQ4n6Ysw-uR5y\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":13,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"sema.ce.gov.br\",\"data\":\"This method allowed him to calculate the area under a parabola and the volumes of spheres and cylinders.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFwIBnC37tZUpDYxwPDzq224hgYASDNEAR5Zog3xfRlE9sJBbTOq8oC0bv-5JL5lOkPf9Lo4Cf01TTPnqC3xbyLBRiA8fdliTW1C1iMDcnFsLdX3sEotoHKiFewKaI8JxOD510gWSMjuY26jt0SA5FitLUhfehCmSE8CtKmFqw32o2bdsoS5iNlLuphPr4ky-c4vsRuuzHPZJevXRE=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":14,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pnccs.edu.in\",\"data\":\"*   **Calculating Pi:** Archimedes provided a precise approximation of the value of pi (\\u03c0).\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH_NbXnA_Mb4p2soRPEZV13yoJnChXYcRJ2Rc3j6B3Zk6bX7yI_49empfb6yX9TloamQ2SxStuGfmR3c3otre8674_puUZW1zTf5GJV0J0bZZ7Mb_ij9g5l7OkyB12mOyZGkA3GIZiEFgrODJ0ae3Qr3ibBwRXNUxNRGLoW0bA-oZ8r5rSj2CQn0F_g8-4=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":15,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"pnccs.edu.in\",\"data\":\"Using inscribed and circumscribed polygons, he determined that pi lies between 3 1/7 and 3 10/71, with the fraction 22/7 still a commonly used approximation today.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQH_NbXnA_Mb4p2soRPEZV13yoJnChXYcRJ2Rc3j6B3Zk6bX7yI_49empfb6yX9TloamQ2SxStuGfmR3c3otre8674_puUZW1zTf5GJV0J0bZZ7Mb_ij9g5l7OkyB12mOyZGkA3GIZiEFgrODJ0ae3Qr3ibBwRXNUxNRGLoW0bA-oZ8r5rSj2CQn0F_g8-4=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":16,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"Using inscribed and circumscribed polygons, he determined that pi lies between 3 1/7 and 3 10/71, with the fraction 22/7 still a commonly used approximation today.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGLM_ZUNEB9-vCcOzNxQQ-HtEBLKR5kOH69FmQr7VROcfasLuCS_upaHtAYXZIP3spkEp8RarRhzIwIHWQ31WHQ2ySjxEyHh_XCZpcnSGLLiFpfsvS_rK1Wg7qmrf9a8g==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":17,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"study.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Geometry of Spheres and Cylinders:** He famously proved that the volume of a sphere is two-thirds the volume of a cylinder that encloses it.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGqVYNLy8QHv9PsZ_r57TozjVUurCKqkGGs-jq-4F1FRcI6XAckbkwp-ZDZq67RAXnjIIxiOcan1pm8A614PwwUsyKzURP62EsFqU0kGXP2JVgOkNJ1RrIfT9Xo23herT2N5aYLyUnAgPP0_iknGK5Hnqj2b5V7pj1jtar33pLHEFtF_xFVKseSk4q2srEZY36J4KdwR3hl9jzY\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":18,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"zmescience.com\",\"data\":\"He also determined the surface area of a sphere.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEM45TcJnMYAh18zUgn-T6dUDjd3DfCO-JaxfizrY0GBuAhkbo-MLH5jIQqG5Ax44e6A2zCjRefuLCDMgahpm8FSCs8pkG3ew8Hpj0VFfVK3e9ENi7zcMLUk5gNFPPW7AAaROiSUa1scvKCRLFX8o20NiH970Uf7DGoHIL576B4nvgsIKTNsg==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":19,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"So proud was he of this discovery that he requested it be inscribed on his tomb.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfZa1LohQOtO3pE6Q3q9569dhQ-fd6cjFc0lqDn_qdTw7J98v9JKZCvTzNqKVMP28CJQ--d2Jc7--u6M5zs1XnjoGDCiPHzsI6EjEoMngtOfDNvgAytpCj75Ow1QwYYVbS9Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":20,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"*   **Large Numbers:** Archimedes devised a system using exponentiation for expressing very large numbers, which he outlined in his work *The Sandreckoner*.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEzmnHAg-PuDtAxx88NlWf33ipKlZ1PMqDc-dHecvJDz2NTy__ofnXQG0qpBgpjHGwyNrCDcAdZxdj0zlgw-ELoOAjxd-TQeyCFAtuY-0dbwpH2jhaTWAgE1h8GEeeSzu-MCY1ap5IX7YRiyUR90oSnLypwgq5yTQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":21,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"*   **Large Numbers:** Archimedes devised a system using exponentiation for expressing very large numbers, which he outlined in his work *The Sandreckoner*.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfZa1LohQOtO3pE6Q3q9569dhQ-fd6cjFc0lqDn_qdTw7J98v9JKZCvTzNqKVMP28CJQ--d2Jc7--u6M5zs1XnjoGDCiPHzsI6EjEoMngtOfDNvgAytpCj75Ow1QwYYVbS9Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":22,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"weebly.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** He established the laws of levers and pulleys, which allow heavy objects to be moved with minimal force.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHRYL3sRQ9jEKgesCNeiDDvuXygMSnnLeQwPAUTmGUub6vPqBS__Pk6YBvwxj3qbebumbyeC9g-PtBd5gxJlOXcWG1KZyjjcnP7pN3tKdSALNvX789R8v__wLOD0fWKOtO0CHMnDMkzONvZq_mFmNYv\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":23,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Law of the Lever:** He established the laws of levers and pulleys, which allow heavy objects to be moved with minimal force.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGLM_ZUNEB9-vCcOzNxQQ-HtEBLKR5kOH69FmQr7VROcfasLuCS_upaHtAYXZIP3spkEp8RarRhzIwIHWQ31WHQ2ySjxEyHh_XCZpcnSGLLiFpfsvS_rK1Wg7qmrf9a8g==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":24,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"st-andrews.ac.uk\",\"data\":\"This understanding of mechanics and the center of gravity was fundamental to his inventions.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEzmnHAg-PuDtAxx88NlWf33ipKlZ1PMqDc-dHecvJDz2NTy__ofnXQG0qpBgpjHGwyNrCDcAdZxdj0zlgw-ELoOAjxd-TQeyCFAtuY-0dbwpH2jhaTWAgE1h8GEeeSzu-MCY1ap5IX7YRiyUR90oSnLypwgq5yTQ==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":25,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"wikipedia.org\",\"data\":\"This understanding of mechanics and the center of gravity was fundamental to his inventions.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfZa1LohQOtO3pE6Q3q9569dhQ-fd6cjFc0lqDn_qdTw7J98v9JKZCvTzNqKVMP28CJQ--d2Jc7--u6M5zs1XnjoGDCiPHzsI6EjEoMngtOfDNvgAytpCj75Ow1QwYYVbS9Q==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":26,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"weebly.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Hydrostatics and Buoyancy:** Archimedes is perhaps most famous for his principle of buoyancy.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHRYL3sRQ9jEKgesCNeiDDvuXygMSnnLeQwPAUTmGUub6vPqBS__Pk6YBvwxj3qbebumbyeC9g-PtBd5gxJlOXcWG1KZyjjcnP7pN3tKdSALNvX789R8v__wLOD0fWKOtO0CHMnDMkzONvZq_mFmNYv\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":27,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"byjus.com\",\"data\":\"The story goes that he had a \\\"Eureka!\\\" moment in his bath upon realizing that an object submerged in a fluid experiences an upward buoyant force equal to the weight of the fluid it displaces.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGLM_ZUNEB9-vCcOzNxQQ-HtEBLKR5kOH69FmQr7VROcfasLuCS_upaHtAYXZIP3spkEp8RarRhzIwIHWQ31WHQ2ySjxEyHh_XCZpcnSGLLiFpfsvS_rK1Wg7qmrf9a8g==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":28,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"zmescience.com\",\"data\":\"This principle allowed him to determine if a crown was made of pure gold without damaging it.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEM45TcJnMYAh18zUgn-T6dUDjd3DfCO-JaxfizrY0GBuAhkbo-MLH5jIQqG5Ax44e6A2zCjRefuLCDMgahpm8FSCs8pkG3ew8Hpj0VFfVK3e9ENi7zcMLUk5gNFPPW7AAaROiSUa1scvKCRLFX8o20NiH970Uf7DGoHIL576B4nvgsIKTNsg==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":29,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"weebly.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This device, consisting of a screw-shaped surface inside a hollow pipe, was designed to raise water efficiently and is still used today for irrigation and moving liquids and granulated solids.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHRYL3sRQ9jEKgesCNeiDDvuXygMSnnLeQwPAUTmGUub6vPqBS__Pk6YBvwxj3qbebumbyeC9g-PtBd5gxJlOXcWG1KZyjjcnP7pN3tKdSALNvX789R8v__wLOD0fWKOtO0CHMnDMkzONvZq_mFmNYv\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":30,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"study.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Archimedes Screw:** This device, consisting of a screw-shaped surface inside a hollow pipe, was designed to raise water efficiently and is still used today for irrigation and moving liquids and granulated solids.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGqVYNLy8QHv9PsZ_r57TozjVUurCKqkGGs-jq-4F1FRcI6XAckbkwp-ZDZq67RAXnjIIxiOcan1pm8A614PwwUsyKzURP62EsFqU0kGXP2JVgOkNJ1RrIfT9Xo23herT2N5aYLyUnAgPP0_iknGK5Hnqj2b5V7pj1jtar33pLHEFtF_xFVKseSk4q2srEZY36J4KdwR3hl9jzY\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":31,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"studysmarter.co.uk\",\"data\":\"These include the **Claw of Archimedes**, a large crane-like machine used to lift and capsize enemy ships, and enhancements to the catapult.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGvlL-q6_eurNTSpUh5qJQMRrHrCiu_-XPof3O2h1CNL5O--Wurch-7_LuIsiJVWWAnZcWGr3xwGhQVGJdcdF53VBLQGtAenSAHmdBr9Wr1hhqh6eV30cG7m8w4B8kg9XPh7tMBO2j6l9xastb8-K9ywJLh7c6Qj6VfN18LTdNZ98sfiiizMfhrQ4n6Ysw-uR5y\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":32,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"study.com\",\"data\":\"These include the **Claw of Archimedes**, a large crane-like machine used to lift and capsize enemy ships, and enhancements to the catapult.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGqVYNLy8QHv9PsZ_r57TozjVUurCKqkGGs-jq-4F1FRcI6XAckbkwp-ZDZq67RAXnjIIxiOcan1pm8A614PwwUsyKzURP62EsFqU0kGXP2JVgOkNJ1RrIfT9Xo23herT2N5aYLyUnAgPP0_iknGK5Hnqj2b5V7pj1jtar33pLHEFtF_xFVKseSk4q2srEZY36J4KdwR3hl9jzY\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":33,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"zmescience.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Heat Ray:** Legend tells of \\\"burning mirrors\\\" that could focus sunlight to set Roman ships on fire, though the historical accuracy of this invention is debated.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEM45TcJnMYAh18zUgn-T6dUDjd3DfCO-JaxfizrY0GBuAhkbo-MLH5jIQqG5Ax44e6A2zCjRefuLCDMgahpm8FSCs8pkG3ew8Hpj0VFfVK3e9ENi7zcMLUk5gNFPPW7AAaROiSUa1scvKCRLFX8o20NiH970Uf7DGoHIL576B4nvgsIKTNsg==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":34,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"youtube.com\",\"data\":\"*   **Compound Pulleys:** He designed complex pulley systems that enabled a single person to lift enormous weights, such as a fully loaded ship.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGW0xwVdr7Ee5TXCl7sPYxnnsi29f2XWIap3ew8VuByZ05MvVDSqWfjOD2lai0xLnmEXw0zod43yaaaiLSitf75QW5ynZesZ-HKIHkwp1cuhttC7yavnELQ82S72OZeNyKxECNlSg==\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"custom_content\":{\"attachments\":[{\"index\":35,\"type\":\"text/markdown\",\"title\":\"historyextra.com\",\"data\":\"*   **The Odometer:** The Roman architect and engineer Vitruvius credited Archimedes with inventing an early odometer during the First Punic War, a device that could measure distance by dropping a pebble into a box after a set number of wheel revolutions.\",\"reference_url\":\"https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQGkknck3Cyk6MoryXJITQhMGwKuhaaDIao7ld8W5Bgi5XAltAPezibUuG80a5Pj-2uvsqsQz97I8fLs973VirqNpgMSRkP_aJpvEb7ujqf0sfUU2D6pu6Bg_8cVHPCxoKdUkcR-M0dkfkdLhrVBCplBJOWr73FgxsVNy8RIOpi18F6xzCKBk7w-hmDUs9rWPhAB1Fiaia3TIlHAZlw=\",\"reference_type\":\"text/markdown\"}]}}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":null,\"delta\":{\"content\":\"\"}}],\"usage\":null,\"id\":\"d6b9600b-105d-4749-8d10-047146c639f7\",\"created\":1770293131,\"object\":\"chat.completion.chunk\",\"model\":\"gemini-2.5-pro\"}\n\ndata: {\"choices\":[{\"index\":0,\"finish_reason\":\"stop\",\"delta\":{}}],\"usage\":